        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 3.6 Arbitration – Rules of Procedure. Arbitration proceedings shall be in accordance with the following:",
            "block_bbox": [
                107,
                678,
                734,
                719
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    107.0,
                    678.0
                ],
                [
                    734.0,
                    678.0
                ],
                [
                    734.0,
                    719.0
                ],
                [
                    107.0,
                    719.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3.6(a) The arbiter shall hear and accept pertinent evidence submitted by both parties and shall be empowered to request such data as the arbiter deems pertinent to the grievance and shall render a decision in writing to both parties within sixty (60) days (unless mutually extended) of the completion of the hearing.",
            "block_bbox": [
                131,
                734,
                734,
                815
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    131.0,
                    734.0
                ],
                [
                    734.0,
                    734.0
                ],
                [
                    734.0,
                    815.0
                ],
                [
                    131.0,
                    815.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3.6(b) The arbiter shall be authorized to rule and issue a decision in writing on the issue presented for arbitration, which decision shall be final and binding on both parties.",
            "block_bbox": [
                126,
                829,
                736,
                871
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    126.0,
                    829.0
                ],
                [
                    736.0,
                    829.0
                ],
                [
                    736.0,
                    871.0
                ],
                [
                    126.0,
                    871.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3.6(c) The arbiter shall rule only on the basis of information presented in the hearing and shall refuse to receive any information after the hearing except when there is mutual agreement, in the presence of both parties.",
            "block_bbox": [
                130,
                886,
                733,
                946
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
